WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:05.061
This video shows how to issue a library book to a student on a phone.

00:00:06.737 --> 00:00:14.201
Tap the menu button, open Library and choose Issue / Return. The Issue Book tab is ready.

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:26.189
Choose Student or Staff, then type at least two letters of the name, here Usm, and tap the person in the list.

00:00:27.524 --> 00:00:34.940
Type part of the book title, here Alg, and tap the book. Only books with copies available are listed.

00:00:36.086 --> 00:00:44.438
The due date is already filled in from the loan period, 14 days from today. Change it only if this loan is different.

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:52.756
Tap Issue Book. A message confirms it, and the loan appears in the Currently Issued Books list below.

00:01:15.999 --> 00:01:18.999
The loan is on record with its due date.
